WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Naarchy. A little space for everything.
Your desktop's little island.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Your day. Within reach.
Music. Focus. Your next move.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.000
One little island. Your everyday desktop.
Click. Carry on.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
Put it down. Pick it up.
Files, images, and text. Ready when you are.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
Copied. Never lost.
Your clipboard history. On your machine.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
Make room for what's next.
Your calendar. One little island.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.000
Naarchy. Free. Open source. Yours to keep.
